##### 1. Onboard: three profiles become one component with a class base per class  [08:54:36]
Onboarding plan: 1 component made from 3 profiles over 4 clusters, one variant per cluster per component (4 variants).
Nothing has changed. This is what ConfigHub would hold.

kyverno  (selects one class per class: prod, test, uat)
  base     mer-kyverno-base  reaches no cluster: clusterRefs is empty
  class    prod         mer-kyverno-class-prod  from profile kyverno-prod; the same as the base
  class    test         mer-kyverno-class-test  from profile kyverno-test; differs from the base in spec.helmCharts[0].values
  class    uat          mer-kyverno-class-uat  from profile kyverno-uat; differs from the base in spec.helmCharts[0].values
